# Service worker files must never be cached long-term — if they were, a
# tablet's browser/WebView could get stuck loading an old app shell
# forever and never notice a new deploy exists. Everything else in dist/
# already gets Netlify's normal cache-busting via hashed filenames.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
/workbox-*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
/registerSW.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
